{
  "title": "Medical API v5: experimento de caos (latencia saliente hacia Angel)",
  "uid": "medical-caos-v5",
  "tags": ["medical-api", "chaos", "v5"],
  "timezone": "America/Bogota",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "15s",
  "time": { "from": "now-30m", "to": "now" },
  "description": "Ronda 0 (sin protecciones) contra ronda 1 (timeout + circuit breaker + respuesta degradada). Datos: OpenTelemetry del coordinador en GKE (metricas http auto instrumentadas y las del experimento) y trazas en Tempo. La ventana de inyeccion se ve en el panel 'Fallo activo' y como anotacion.",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "ds_prom",
        "label": "Prometheus (metricas OTLP)",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "ds_tempo",
        "label": "Tempo (trazas)",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "tempo",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "job",
        "label": "Servicio (job)",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prom}" },
        "query": "label_values(flow_requests_total, job)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": false,
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "ruta",
        "type": "constant",
        "query": "/api/v5/flujo/:imagenId",
        "hide": 2
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "Fallo inyectado (interruptor de caos)",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prom}" },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "red",
        "expr": "max by (peer, type) (chaos_fault_active{job=\"$job\"}) == 1",
        "step": "15s",
        "titleFormat": "Fallo activo: {{peer}} ({{type}})",
        "useValueForTime": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Metrica objetivo: p95 del flujo por ronda (ms)",
      "description": "p95 de GET /api/v5/flujo/:imagenId. Ronda 0 y ronda 1 como lineas separadas. Linea roja: umbral de 2000 ms de chaos/slo.json.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prom}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, round) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"$job\", route=\"$ruta\"}[2m]))) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "ronda {{round}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 2000 } ] },
          "custom": { "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "line" } }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Resultado del flujo por segundo (ok, degradado, error)",
      "description": "flow_requests_total por resultado y ronda. En la ronda 0 el fallo produce 'error' (502); en la ronda 1 produce 'degradado' (200 con campos en null).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prom}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (outcome, round) (rate(flow_requests_total{job=\"$job\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}} (ronda {{round}})"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia p95 de cada dependencia (ms)",
      "description": "dependency_request_duration_seconds por compañero. Con el fallo activo Angel sube a 3000 ms en la ronda 0 y queda cortado en 2000 ms (timeout) o en 0 ms (circuito abierto) en la ronda 1.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prom}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 9 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, peer, round) (rate(dependency_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"$job\"}[2m]))) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "{{peer}} (ronda {{round}})"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ms" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Resultado de las llamadas salientes por segundo",
      "description": "ok, timeout, error o circuito_abierto por compañero.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prom}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 9 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (peer, outcome) (rate(dependency_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"$job\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{peer}}: {{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Fallo activo en el interruptor de caos (ventana de inyeccion)",
      "description": "1 mientras el fallo esta activo (POST /internal/chaos hasta DELETE o vencimiento del TTL).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prom}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 18 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (peer, type) (chaos_fault_active{job=\"$job\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{peer}} {{type}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 } ] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Estado del circuit breaker por compañero (0 cerrado, 1 abierto, 2 semiabierto)",
      "description": "Solo cambia en la ronda 1. El circuito abre tras 5 llamadas con mas del 50 % de fallos y prueba de nuevo a los 10 s.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prom}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 18 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (peer) (circuit_breaker_state{job=\"$job\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{peer}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 }, { "color": "orange", "value": 2 } ] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tasa de error del flujo (5xx) por ronda",
      "description": "Metrica de guarda del experimento (umbral 5 %).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prom}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(sum by (round) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"$job\", route=\"$ruta\", status_code=~\"5..\"}[1m])) or sum by (round) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"$job\", route=\"$ruta\"}[1m])) * 0) / sum by (round) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"$job\", route=\"$ruta\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "ronda {{round}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.05 } ] },
          "custom": { "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "line" } }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Peticiones al flujo por segundo y por pod",
      "description": "Reparto de la carga de k6 entre las dos replicas de GKE.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prom}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 24 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (instance) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"$job\", route=\"$ruta\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia p95 del cliente HTTP por destino (auto instrumentada)",
      "description": "http_client_request_duration_seconds de la instrumentacion undici: la misma latencia saliente vista por OpenTelemetry, por host de destino.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${ds_prom}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 24 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, server_address) (rate(http_client_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"$job\"}[2m]))) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "{{server_address}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ms" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Trazas del flujo (Tempo): buscar por trace id de k6 o de la demo",
      "description": "Cada traza muestra el span del flujo y los spans hijos hacia Angel y Juan con el mismo trace id. Filtre por el atributo http.request.header.x_trace_id o por duracion > 2 s.",
      "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "${ds_tempo}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 32 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"api-c-documentos\" && span.http.route = \"/api/v5/flujo/:imagenId\" }",
          "limit": 50,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
